### IntelliJ HTTP Client file. Open it in IntelliJ and click the green arrow next to each request.

### Hello with a default and with a query parameter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello?name=Sara

### All tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?done=true

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?search=spring

### One task, then one that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/99

### Create (201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Write tests"}

### Replace
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Learn Spring Boot", "done": true}

### Complete
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2/complete

### Delete (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/3
